És cert,

1645
00:35:30,310 --> 00:35:30,950
ens fa polir

1646
00:35:30,950 --> 00:35:32,250
el missatge constantment.

1647
00:35:33,090 --> 00:35:33,410
Clar,

1648
00:35:33,750 --> 00:35:34,410
ens obliga

1649
00:35:34,410 --> 00:35:35,250
a aturar-nos

1650
00:35:35,250 --> 00:35:35,870
i a demanar

1651
00:35:35,870 --> 00:35:36,470
que l'altre

1652
00:35:36,470 --> 00:35:37,470
ens expliqui

1653
00:35:37,470 --> 00:35:39,250
amb les seves pròpies paraules

1654
00:35:39,250 --> 00:35:40,890
què redimonis ha entès

1655
00:35:40,890 --> 00:35:42,270
per evitar malentesos

1656
00:35:42,270 --> 00:35:43,030
que podrien ser

1657
00:35:43,030 --> 00:35:44,030
catastròfics

1658
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:45,090
en l'àmbit laboral.

1659
00:35:45,630 --> 00:35:45,670
A veure,

1660
00:35:45,690 --> 00:35:46,210
ens força,

1661
00:35:46,330 --> 00:35:46,830
a més a més,

1662
00:35:47,050 --> 00:35:48,670
a buscar múltiples perspectives

1663
00:35:48,670 --> 00:35:49,170
de to

1664
00:35:49,170 --> 00:35:50,330
o d'argumentació

1665
00:35:50,330 --> 00:35:51,350
abans de prendre

1666
00:35:51,350 --> 00:35:52,290
una decisió final

1667
00:35:52,290 --> 00:35:53,450
i a no refiar-nos

1668
00:35:53,450 --> 00:35:54,970
mai d'una veritat absoluta

1669
00:35:54,970 --> 00:35:55,510
que no estigui

1670
00:35:55,510 --> 00:35:56,610
degudament contrastada

1671
00:35:56,610 --> 00:35:57,850
per nosaltres mateixos.

1672
00:35:58,250 --> 00:35:59,850
És tot un exercici mental.

1673
00:36:00,750 --> 00:36:01,010
Llavors,

1674
00:36:01,110 --> 00:36:02,250
la pregunta és inevitable.

1675
00:36:02,830 --> 00:36:04,390
Si tota aquesta interacció diària,

1676
00:36:04,630 --> 00:36:05,270
hora rere hora,

1677
00:36:05,610 --> 00:36:06,770
amb una màquina freda,

1678
00:36:06,890 --> 00:36:07,790
ens està obligant,

1679
00:36:07,910 --> 00:36:08,350
de facto,

1680
00:36:08,610 --> 00:36:09,590
a exercitar de valent

1681
00:36:09,590 --> 00:36:11,110
tots aquests músculs essencials

1682
00:36:11,110 --> 00:36:11,690
de l'empatia cognitiva,

1683
00:36:12,710 --> 00:36:13,330
de la paciència

1684
00:36:13,330 --> 00:36:14,650
i de la precisió semàntica,

1685
00:36:14,650 --> 00:36:15,630
ens podríem estar

1686
00:36:15,630 --> 00:36:16,210
entrenant

1687
00:36:16,210 --> 00:36:17,150
sense donar-nos

1688
00:36:17,150 --> 00:36:18,190
en absolutament de res

1689
00:36:18,190 --> 00:36:19,150
per acabar sent

1690
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,130
millors comunicadors

1691
00:36:20,130 --> 00:36:21,470
amb la resta de sers humans

1692
00:36:21,470 --> 00:36:22,470
de carn i ossos?

1693
00:36:22,630 --> 00:36:23,010
Uf!

1694
00:36:24,150 --> 00:36:24,490
Ostres,

1695
00:36:24,590 --> 00:36:25,330
quina gran pregunta!

1696
00:36:25,730 --> 00:36:26,930
Jo crec que potser sí.

1697
00:36:27,250 --> 00:36:27,590
Potser,

1698
00:36:27,930 --> 00:36:28,890
en el fons de tot,

1699
00:36:29,330 --> 00:36:30,550
aquest geni trampós

1700
00:36:30,550 --> 00:36:31,730
dels llibres antics

1701
00:36:31,730 --> 00:36:32,950
ens està revelant

1702
00:36:32,950 --> 00:36:33,510
molt més

1703
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:34,250
sobre la nostra

1704
00:36:34,250 --> 00:36:35,410
pròpia fragilitat

1705
00:36:35,410 --> 00:36:37,070
i les nostres presses

1706
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:38,350
a l'hora d'entendre'ns

1707
00:36:38,350 --> 00:36:39,390
els uns amb els altres

1708
00:36:39,390 --> 00:36:40,590
a l'oficina o a casa

1709
00:36:40,590 --> 00:36:41,550
que no pas

1710
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:42,870
sobre la tecnologia en si.

1711
00:36:43,190 --> 00:36:44,110
És una reflexió

1712
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:44,870
d'aquelles que,

1713
00:36:45,170 --> 00:36:45,610
sincerament,

1714
00:36:45,630 --> 00:36:46,630
conviden a ser explorades

1715
00:36:47,210 --> 00:36:47,930
en profunditat

1716
00:36:47,930 --> 00:36:48,590
en algun moment.

1717
00:36:48,950 --> 00:36:49,790
Em sembla molt,

1718
00:36:50,010 --> 00:36:50,570
molt encertada

1719
00:36:50,570 --> 00:36:51,850
aquesta visió humanista

1720
00:36:51,850 --> 00:36:52,470
del fenomen.

1721
00:36:52,690 --> 00:36:53,530
Doncs ho deixem aquí

1722
00:36:53,530 --> 00:36:54,350
com una bona idea

1723
00:36:54,350 --> 00:36:55,030
per rumiar

1724
00:36:55,030 --> 00:36:56,470
mentre la tecnologia

1725
00:36:56,470 --> 00:36:57,470
inaturable

1726
00:36:57,470 --> 00:36:58,630
segueix avançant

1727
00:36:58,630 --> 00:37:00,010
al seu ritme frenètic.

1728
00:37:00,490 --> 00:37:01,130
La veritat és que

1729
00:37:01,130 --> 00:37:01,830
ha estat un viatge

1730
00:37:01,830 --> 00:37:02,630
molt revelador

1731
00:37:02,630 --> 00:37:03,590
a seures avui

1732
00:37:03,590 --> 00:37:04,650
intentar comprendre

1733
00:37:04,650 --> 00:37:05,730
els secrets més amagats

1734
00:37:05,730 --> 00:37:06,910
d'aquesta llanterna màgica

1735
00:37:06,910 --> 00:37:07,510
tan particular

1736
00:37:07,510 --> 00:37:08,070
de la qual

1737
00:37:08,070 --> 00:37:08,830
tothom parla

1738
00:37:08,830 --> 00:37:09,790
però pocs dominen.

1739
00:37:10,030 --> 00:37:10,910
He gaudit molt

1740
00:37:10,910 --> 00:37:11,550
de l'anàlisi,

1741
00:37:11,650 --> 00:37:12,030
de veritat.

1742
00:37:12,030 --> 00:37:12,790
Un plaer.

1743
00:37:13,210 --> 00:37:14,250
El plaer ha estat meu.

1744
00:37:14,930 --> 00:37:15,610
Ens retrobem

1745
00:37:15,610 --> 00:37:16,030
aviat

1746
00:37:16,030 --> 00:37:17,450
per continuar analitzant

1747
00:37:17,450 --> 00:37:17,930
junts

1748
00:37:17,930 --> 00:37:19,230
temes apassionants.

1749
00:37:19,770 --> 00:37:20,470
Fins a la propera

1750
00:37:20,470 --> 00:37:21,350
immersió profunda.

1751
00:37:21,750 --> 00:37:22,470
Cuideu-vos molt.

